fa-e547-4a5c-8f4e-7ea7e16f8bde.png","line":66,"embedded":true},{"title":"$27 million to U.S. Antimony Corp.","target":"https://www.war.gov/News/Releases/Release/Article/4421101/department-of-war-invests-27m-for-the-domestic-excavation-extraction-processing/","line":70},{"title":"early exploration indicates significant antimony deposits","target":"https://resolutionminerals.com/investor-centre/high-antimony-recoveries-in-metallurgy-from-antimony-ridge/","line":72},{"title":"FAST-41 project","target":"https://www.permitting.gov/projects/title-41-fixing-americas-surface-transportation-act-fast-41","line":74},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":76,"embedded":true},{"title":"as Valley Lookout reported","target":"https://valleylookout.com/2025/10/20/australian-mining-company-expands-horse-heaven-project-as-trump-agrees-to-8-5b-critical-minerals-deal/","line":80},{"title":"The FAST-41 designation","target":"https://www.permits.performance.gov/permitting-project/fast-41-transparency-projects/antimony-ridge-mine-project","line":80}],"metadata":{"title":"‘Important milestone’: Federal funds sought for critical minerals exploration near Yellow Pine","source":"https://valleylookout.com/2026/07/02/important-milestone-federal-funds-sought-for-critical-minerals-exploration-near-yellow-pine/","author":["[[Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor]]"],"published":"2026-07-02","created":"2026-07-08","description":"An Australian mining company conducting exploratory drilling near Yellow Pine is hoping to enlist the help of the federal government.  Resolution Minerals of Adelaide, Australia, recently applied for funding from the U.S. Department of War to fund exploration of Antimony Ridge, one of two key zones in the company’s 23-square-mile Horse Heaven Project.  The amount of […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},